# Bee - Gameplay

The gameplay involves cultivating Your flowers so Your bees can produce the best honey possible.
The better Your honey, the higher will be the price You can sell it for.
You can also upgrade Your bee hive and Your flowers.
This will help You make more money, but it will also make Your garden much more beautiful!

If You would like to know where You can download the game, click on #1.
If You would like to know the story of the game, click on #2.